This product includes software developed by third parties:

* src/camera/CameraPool.hpp contains definitions (gralloc usage flags and the
  private_handle_t buffer handle layout) derived from the Qualcomm qmmf-sdk
  (common/memory/qmmf_memory_interface.h) and from the Qualcomm CamX / CHI-CDK
  camera HAL headers. They are reproduced to stay binary compatible with the
  Qualcomm camera HAL on the QCS8550.

* The firmware links third-party libraries that are built with vcpkg (for
  example fmt, spdlog, nlohmann-json, libarchive, yaml-cpp, xtensor, XLink).
  Their licenses and notices are listed in the firmware package license bundle
  (depthai-device-rvc4-fwp-LICENSE), which the build generates next to the
  firmware package.

The binary firmware package (depthai-device-rvc4-fwp.tar.xz) bundles
proprietary components that are not in this repository: the STMicroelectronics
VD55H1 IPP library (ST license SLA0106) and Qualcomm-derived code from the
private depthai-device-rvc4-vendor module. The firmware package is therefore
distributed under the Luxonis Firmware Package License (LICENSE.fwp), while
the MIT License applies to the source code in this directory.
